<section class="scd-flow" id="smart-connect-discovery" aria-labelledby="scd-flow-title">
  <div class="scd-flow__header animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
    <h2 id="scd-flow-title">The Full Directory, or AI Recommendations, Your Call</h2>
    <p>Choose how attendees discover people at your event. They stay in control of every connection.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="scd-flow__quad">
    <article class="scd-flow__cell scd-flow__cell--copy scd-flow__cell--browse animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <h3>Browse the Full Directory</h3>
      <p>Attendees open networking from the EventHex mobile experience, then search and explore the people available in their event.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="scd-flow__cell scd-flow__cell--media scd-flow__cell--directory animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInRight">
      <div class="scd-directory-composite">
        <img class="scd-directory-composite__screen scd-directory-composite__screen--primary" src="/feature-images/ai-smart-connect/networking-settings-profile-fields.webp" alt="EventHex profile-card field settings for the attendee networking directory" width="600" height="550" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <img class="scd-directory-composite__screen scd-directory-composite__screen--secondary" src="/feature-images/ai-smart-connect/networking-settings-sorting.webp" alt="EventHex attendee directory sorting settings" width="600" height="550" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <img class="scd-directory-composite__screen scd-directory-composite__screen--detail" src="/feature-images/ai-smart-connect/networking-settings-features.webp" alt="EventHex networking feature settings" width="600" height="550" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="scd-directory-composite__status"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg>Profile cards configured</span>
        <span class="scd-directory-composite__action">Explore directory</span>
        <img class="scd-directory-composite__cursor" src="/feature-images/event-registration/cursor.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scd-flow__cell scd-flow__cell--media scd-flow__cell--recommendation animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInLeft">
      <div class="scd-preview-stage scd-preview-stage--recommendation">
        <span class="scd-preview-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <img class="scd-settings-shot" src="/feature-images/ai-smart-connect/networking-settings-features.webp" alt="EventHex networking settings with AI Recommendations and Similar People enabled" width="600" height="550" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <span class="scd-chip scd-chip--recommend"><b>✦ AI Recommended</b><small>Relevant profiles first</small></span>
        <span class="scd-chip scd-chip--match"><i></i><b>Similar people enabled</b></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="scd-flow__cell scd-flow__cell--copy scd-flow__cell--recommended-copy animate-on-scroll" data-animation="fadeInUp">
      <h3>Start With AI Recommended</h3>
      <p>Organizers enable AI Recommendations and Similar People; attendees get a focused set of profiles to review before choosing whether to connect.</p>
    </article>

    <span class="scd-flow__cross" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="-14 -14 28 28"><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#eef0f3"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#eef0f3" transform="scale(1,-1)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#eef0f3" transform="rotate(90)"></path><path d="M-14,0 A14,14 0 0,1 0,14 A14,14 0 0,1 14,0 Z" fill="#eef0f3" transform="rotate(-90)"></path></svg>
    </span>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .scd-flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:40px 24px;background:#fff}.scd-flow__header{display:flex;max-width:1100px;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center}.scd-flow__header h2{margin:0 0 12px;background:linear-gradient(98deg,var(--heading-dark,#1e1d24) 43.06%,#8f8f8f 91.81%);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent;font:500 clamp(28px,4.2vw,48px)/1.1 var(--font-heading);letter-spacing:-.04em}.scd-flow__header p{max-width:640px;margin:0;color:var(--subheading-gray,#555);font:400 18px/1.5 var(--font-body)}
